{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bayaya is a story-driven fairytale adventure with relaxing life-sim elements. Explore a handcrafted wooden-toy world, help villagers through honest work, and follow the journey of Prince Bayaya as he leaves the castle to find his own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core of Bayaya is simple, tangible activity: chopping wood, tending gardens, carrying logs, helping farmers, watching life unfold in a living village. As you work and explore, a larger story slowly reveals itself \u2014 about family, duty, and a danger waiting beyond the horizon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/be7af1f3d761a9cea3b1cd23c8c0a36b.poster.avif?t=1764598431\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/be7af1f3d761a9cea3b1cd23c8c0a36b.webm?t=1764598431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/be7af1f3d761a9cea3b1cd23c8c0a36b.mp4?t=1764598431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fairytale story about work, kindness, and courage</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gentle narrative inspired loosely by the Czech folk tale of Prince Bayaya. No rushing, no pressure \u2014 just a slowly unfolding story in a peaceful world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing village work</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop wood, gather vegetables, tend small gardens, carry logs, or simply observe the villagers as they go about their routines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light RPG and story moments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn from your talking horse, meet villagers, and take part in their stories. Combat exists only as part of the narrative and stays simple and approachable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/b810ad28044f77963615f9ca459a4d35.poster.avif?t=1764598431\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/b810ad28044f77963615f9ca459a4d35.webm?t=1764598431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/b810ad28044f77963615f9ca459a4d35.mp4?t=1764598431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted wooden-toy aesthetic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique visual style inspired by traditional wooden toys. Soft shapes, warm colors, and a world full of small details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/bb6ca4d9cd48521fe75e02ad5fdf6144.poster.avif?t=1764598431\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/bb6ca4d9cd48521fe75e02ad5fdf6144.webm?t=1764598431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/bb6ca4d9cd48521fe75e02ad5fdf6144.mp4?t=1764598431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A living countryside</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Villagers follow their routines, and the environment feels alive even when you simply stop and watch.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3535870?t=1764598431","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3535870?t=1764598431","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/e8075b44d28a57c833adee04b10ae4454f87da78/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764598431","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/e8075b44d28a57c833adee04b10ae4454f87da78/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764598431","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4002490,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bayaya is a story-driven fairytale adventure with relaxing life-sim elements. Explore a handcrafted wooden-toy world, help villagers through honest work, and follow the journey of Prince Bayaya as he leaves the castle to find his own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core of Bayaya is simple, tangible activity: chopping wood, tending gardens, carrying logs, helping farmers, watching life unfold in a living village. As you work and explore, a larger story slowly reveals itself \u2014 about family, duty, and a danger waiting beyond the horizon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/be7af1f3d761a9cea3b1cd23c8c0a36b.poster.avif?t=1764598431\" widt